                     </biblList>
                  </event>
               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm150">C.E.F. Weyse was organist at Reformert Kirke in Copenhagen from 1792; however, it was not until 1805 that he was appointed organist at Vor Frue Kirke. Thus it was his 50th anniversary as organist which was celebrated in 1842. Weyse died shortly after, and Hartmann succeeded him as organist at Vor Frue Kirke in 1843, a post which he held until his death in 1900.</p>
            </history>
